    "description": "Source: Kobi / Joyce doc feedback, 2026-08-10.\n\nSet Deal list view columns, in this order:\n\n1\\. Deal Name\n\n2\\. Status\n\n3\\. Operator\n\n4\\. Partner\n\n5\\. Vertical\n\n6\\. Market\n\n7\\. CPA\n\n8\\. Currency\n\n9\\. Deposit Range\n\n10\\. Effective\n\nNotes:\n\n* 'Market' = the new combined display field from BUILD-118.\n\n* 'Effective' = Effective Start Date (confirm whether a start–end range is wanted).\n\n* 'Deposit Range' is currently two fields (min/max) — needs a display formula, same pattern as Market.\n\n* Priority Tier is deliberately NOT a column (per mockup: 'the deal list no longer shows a priority column').\n\n⚠️ CONFLICT TO RESOLVE: Partner appears as a column here, but Open Questions Q4 decided reps should not see Partner. Assumption: this list view is OPS-facing, and the rep-facing view stays operator-only per BUILD-64. Confirm which profiles get this view.\n\nBlocked by: BUILD-118 (Market), BUILD-117 (Deal Name).",
